+// mpyhhu: Multiply high-high, unsigned, e.g.:
+//
+// +-------+-------+   +-------+-------+   +---------+
+// |  a0   .  a1   | x |  b0   .  b1   | = | a0 x b0 |
+// +-------+-------+   +-------+-------+   +---------+
+//
+// where a0, b0 are the upper 16 bits of the 32-bit word
